---
// One status line on every page while Ichnaea has no release. It replaces Starlight's per-page
// banner, which no page uses.
---

<div class="status-banner" role="note" aria-label="Release status">
  Ichnaea is 0.x and has no release yet. Interfaces can change in any commit. You pin a commit of
  the <code>build</code> branch. The v2 framework is designed and being built. These pages describe
  main today.
</div>

<style>
  .status-banner {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background-color: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
